            "title": "Moment of truth",
            "artist": "FM Static",
            "video": {
                "videoId": "mEQdu4cASS8",
                "title": "Moment of truth — FM Static"
            },
            "lyricCues": [
                {
                    "text": "Here we are",
                    "start": 13.94,
                    "end": 15.89
                },
                {
                    "text": "In the best years of our lives",
                    "start": 15.89,
                    "end": 18.29
                },
                {
                    "text": "With no way of knowing",
                    "start": 18.29,
                    "end": 21.13
                },
                {
                    "text": "When the wheel will stop spinning",
                    "start": 21.13,
                    "end": 22.9
                },
                {
                    "text": "Cause we don't know where we're going",
                    "start": 22.9,
                    "end": 26.16
                },
                {
                    "text": "And here we are",
                    "start": 26.16,
                    "end": 29.09
                },
                {
                    "text": "On the best day of our lives",
                    "start": 29.09,
                    "end": 32.28
                },
                {
                    "text": "And it's a go",
                    "start": 32.28,
                    "end": 33.89
                },
                {
                    "text": "Let's make it last",
                    "start": 33.89,
                    "end": 34.94
                },
                {
                    "text": "So cheers you all to that",
                    "start": 34.94,
                    "end": 36.2
                },
                {
                    "text": "'Cause this moment's never comin' back",
                    "start": 36.2,
                    "end": 39.51
                },
                {
                    "text": "I used to know her brother",
                    "start": 39.51,
                    "end": 41.29
                },
                {
                    "text": "But I never knew I loved her",
                    "start": 41.29,
                    "end": 42.91
                },
                {
                    "text": "'Til the day she laid her eyes on me",
                    "start": 42.91,
                    "end": 45.82
                },
                {
                    "text": "Now I'm jumpin' up and down",
                    "start": 45.82,
                    "end": 47.9
                },
                {
                    "text": "She's the only one around",
                    "start": 47.9,
                    "end": 49.53
                },
                {
                    "text": "And she means every little thing to me",
                    "start": 49.53,
                    "end": 52.35
                },
                {
                    "text": "I've got your picture in my wallet",
                    "start": 52.35,
                    "end": 55.8
                },
